.Dd August 9, 2026
.Dt SLSTATUS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm slstatus
.Nd suckless status
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl s
.Op Fl 1
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reports system status, either via the root window's WM_NAME (default,
for
.Xr dwm 1 )
or over stdout.
For
.Xr dwl 1 Ns 's
built-in bar:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
slstatus -s | dwl
.Ed
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It Fl v
Print version, exit.
.It Fl s
Write to stdout instead of WM_NAME.
.It Fl 1
Write once to stdout, exit.
.El
.Sh CUSTOMIZATION
Edit
.Va args[]
in
.Pa config.h
and recompile; see
.Pa components/
for available functions.
Each entry is
.Sy { function, format, argument } ,
format being a
.Xr printf 3
string.
.Pp
For
.Xr dwl 1 Ns 's
bar
.Pq Fl s ,
format strings may embed
.Sq \&|
to split segments and ANSI SGR color codes; see
.Xr dwl 1 .
.Sh SIGNALS
.Bl -tag -width TERM -compact
.It USR1
Instant redraw.
.El
.Sh AUTHORS
See LICENSE.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dwm 1 ,
.Xr dwl 1
